		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>vous devez passer par un EXECUTE, par exemple :</p><p>&#160; &#160; EXECUTE format(&#039;ALTER SEQUENCE %I<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; MINVALUE 1<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; MAXVALUE 1000<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; START 1<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; INCREMENT 1;&#039;, sequenceObject);</p>]]></content>
